# ste-lint exemptions — files the pre-commit STE gate skips.
# Policy (2026-10-08, hermes ruling, room-delegated): historical ledgers are
# amend-only records (never rewrite). The STE gate covers new prose; these
# files are exempt as a class. New entries in them must still be written
# STE-clean.
# Format: one path per line, relative to repo root, exact match. '#' comments.
docs/agents/instrument-trust-log.md
docs/validation/physics-validation-ledger.md
DECISIONS.md

