# records (relayed reviews and feedback) join the exempt class. They are
# amend-only by nature and never rewritten. New team material in them
# must still be STE-clean.
docs/reporting/feedback/Feedback-message-1791925681590.md
docs/reporting/feedback/kg-equivalence-message-1791973254345.md

